# Structure — siyatha_online_fe

Public site is siyatha.lk. Shop counter is pos.siyatha.lk.

```
src/app/page.tsx home — photo prints, packaging, craft
src/app/photo-prints/ print landing (SEO)
src/app/photo-prints/order/ upload studio
src/app/packaging/ src/app/craft/ department pages
src/app/shop/ full catalog, dept=packaging|craft
src/app/api/photo-prints/upload/ saved under public/uploads/prints
src/lib/storefront.ts prices, pixel hints, keywords, FAQ
src/components/photo-prints/PrintStudio.tsx
src/components/departments/DepartmentPage.tsx
```

Photo print prices and packaging/craft keywords stay in `src/lib/storefront.ts`. Do not add a second price list.
